          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_8Ea43N": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is a charm phone case protective?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_Lzpn3r": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes! Our base cases use a high-quality <strong>silicone base case</strong>, which is naturally shock-absorbent and flexible. </p><p>This means it can <strong>cushion light drops, protect against scratches</strong>, and handle everyday wear, while giving you a <strong>soft, comfortable grip</strong>.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_Lzpn3r"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_rjfdE3": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is a charm phone case heavy?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_pbB7DK": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our cases use a <strong>lightweight silicone base</strong>, so they stay comfortable for everyday use. With the added charms and textures, they can be <strong>slightly heavier than a plain case</strong>, but never in a way that feels bulky.<br/><br/>The weight also depends on how many charms you choose to add, so you get to customise the balance between minimal and extra-cute. </p><p>Either way, every Charmé case is designed to stay practical, stylish, and easy to carry all day.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_pbB7DK"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_WyAjHK": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "CARE & MAINTENANCE",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_UfENHV": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<h5><strong>General care</strong></h5><p>Handle your case with care, avoid bending or peeling, and keep it out of direct sunlight or harsh weather.</p><p>Metals are coated to resist tarnish; you may reapply a clear polish for extra shine if needed.</p><p>After receiving, please leave your phone case in a well-ventilated indoor space for 3–5 days, as it was freshly made and packed in a closed box.</p><p>.</p><p></p><p></p><h5><strong>For white & glitter gel</strong></h5><p>Our white and glitter gel designs use light-toned materials to achieve their signature look. A slight warm tint over time is a natural characteristic.</p><p>To keep your piece looking its best:<br/><br/>• Please avoid contact with makeup, creams, perfumes, and oils<br/><br/>• Please avoid prolonged contact with darker fabrics (e.g. denim)</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_UfENHV"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_xktep7": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Shipping time & cost",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_6rQYtf": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p><strong>All products are handmade in London, UK</strong></p><h5></h5><h5></h5><h5><strong>Processing Time</strong></h5><p><strong>Made-to-Order Cases</strong><br/>Handmade to order. Please allow 4–7 working days for production before dispatch.</p><p><strong>DIY Kits & Ready-Made Items</strong><br/>Dispatched within<strong> </strong>2–3 working days.</p><h4></h4><h5><strong>Shipping Times</strong></h5><ul><li><strong>UK:</strong> 2–3 business days<br/></li><li><strong>USA:</strong> 6–8 business days<br/></li><li><strong>EU:</strong> 3–5 business days<br/></li><li><strong>Rest of World:</strong> 6–8 business days</li></ul><h4></h4><h5><strong>Shipping Costs</strong></h5><ul><li><strong>UK:</strong> From £2.91 · Free over £45<br/></li><li><strong>USA:</strong> $10.99 · Duties & taxes included · Free over $100<br/></li><li><strong>Germany, France & Spain:</strong> €6.99 · Duties & taxes included · Free over €100<br/></li><li><strong>Rest of World: </strong>Worldwide shipping. Calculated at checkout based on destination.</li></ul>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "color": "var(--color-foreground)",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_6rQYtf"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_Rrzh8N": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Returns & Exchanges",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_EjyPh7": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Since each case is handmade just for you, we can’t accept returns or swaps once production has started. Your case is truly one of a kind and can’t be resold.<br/><br/>Triple-check that you’ve chosen the right phone model and charms before placing your order to avoid any heartbreak!</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
